ne\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\"><span>Source: WSJ, </span><a href=\"https://semianalysis.com/tokenomics-model/\"><span>SemiAnalysis Tokenomics Model</span></a></figcaption></figure></div><p>In this article, we’ll dive deep into the work our team has done in the <a href=\"https://semianalysis.com/tokenomics-model/\">Tokenomics Model</a> and walk you through the financial details of Anthropic, how that compares to OpenAI, where we see the market moving, and implications for the value chain and broader AI market. While other SemiAnalysis work focuses on the technical aspects of AI Labs, this piece will focus solely on the current and future financials, margin economics, and long-term outlook for Anthropic. </p>", "has_dynamic_content": false, "truncated_body_text": "When Dario Amodei left OpenAI to start Anthropic in early 2021, the viral release